# F0 retained-find plus E0.1 capability receipt. The ordinary Livery document
# owns matching and reveal; Turnstone observes the same retained model through
# its action spine.
# Network-dependent by design, matching rung4_content.scn. Run on a fresh profile.
settle 30
key escape
open https://example.com/
settle 40
act Toggle live content
settle 40
assert content-live
assert snap actions ~ Find in document
assert snap document-find-capability == supported
assert snap page-zoom-capability == supported
assert snap page-capture-capability ~ unavailable
assert snap navigation-capability ~ partial

key ctrl+f
type documentation
settle 10
assert snap document-find-query == documentation
assert snap document-find-count == 1
assert snap document-find-current == 1
assert a11y searchinput: Find in document = documentation
assert a11y status: 1 of 1 · paragraph
key enter
settle 5
assert snap document-find-current == 1
capture 01_retained_find
log F0 retained find receipt complete
